WEBVTT

00:00:00.267 --> 00:00:13.167
PPCC 2026 is an upcoming opportunity to connect agents, apps, automation, trusted data, and governance to a concrete executive pilot decision.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:25.267
Recommendation: send a focused business, platform, data, and risk team with one mandate: return with a governed AI, app, and automation pilot charter.

00:00:25.833 --> 00:00:32.833
Main conference: October 27-29 at the MGM Grand in Las Vegas.

00:00:32.833 --> 00:00:37.433
Workshops: October 25-26 and October 30.

00:00:37.967 --> 00:00:48.233
PPCC connects agents, apps, automation, and trusted data with implementation, architecture, governance, and AI-driven scenarios.

00:00:48.767 --> 00:00:57.467
Ask the team to return with the workflow, owner, trusted data, guardrails, and testable success measure for one pilot.

00:00:57.467 --> 00:01:02.500
Expansion should depend on that evidence, not conference enthusiasm.
